<title>ALGERIA: Four die, 31 injured in Algerian road accident.</title>
<headline>Four die, 31 injured in Algerian road accident.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four people died and 31 were injured, including 14 seriously, on Sunday when a coach and transport vehicle collided southeast of the capital Algiers, the official Algerian news agency APS said.</p>
<p>The crash occured on the road linking M'sila to Ouled Derraj, about 180 km (110 miles) from Algiers.</p>
